  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja14_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <color=#FF00FF>Sonny...</color> What happened?
  - My body feels very weird... My head... <shake>(COF, COF)</shake>.
  - Ha... Am I that old? Maybe... My time has come?
  - I feel something <color=#00FFFF>wicked</color> inside of me. I just noticed it,
    but it was always there.
  - I don't deserve to live. I don't have a reason. I'm ready... Do what you came
    to do. <color=yellow>Erase the evil from this town, once and for all.</color=yellow>
